{
  "id":"npc_quest_social","title":"当面委托、知情边界和完成后的交谈","requirements":["N2","N16"],"initial":{"mode":"new"},
  "turns":[
    {"input":"我走进青灯酒馆找林穗。","assertions":[{"kind":"equals","path":"state.location","value":"bld_hw_qingdeng"}]},
    {"input":"我提出替林穗买十份燕麦并送来，约定总报酬二十铜，买粮多出的费用由我承担。请她明确是否同意这份私人委托，同意的话就登记并托管报酬，现在不交货。","assertions":[{"kind":"records","path":"state.quests","where":{"publisher":"npc_hw_linsui","status":"公开","reward":20,"escrow":20,"objective.type":"deliver","objective.item":"item_oats","objective.quantity":10},"min":1}]},
    {"input":"我接受刚才这份送十份燕麦的委托，然后问林穗我还需要做什么。","assertions":[{"kind":"records","path":"state.quests","where":{"publisher":"npc_hw_linsui","status":"进行中","taker":"player"},"min":1},{"kind":"records","path":"state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.memoryStream","where":{"kind":"quest"},"min":1}]},
    {"input":"我到北林边找吴朔，只问他知道我现在给谁办什么事吗，不向他透露委托内容。","assertions":[{"kind":"equals","path":"state.location","value":"loc_hw_northwood"},{"kind":"records","path":"state.npcs.npc_hw_wushuo.memoryStream","where":{"kind":"quest"},"max":0,"min":0}]},
    {"input":"我到村务屋，向粮仓柜台购买十份燕麦，现付钱。","assertions":[{"kind":"equals","path":"state.location","value":"bld_hw_council"},{"kind":"quantity","path":"state.inventory.item_oats","value":10}]},
    {"input":"我把买好的燕麦带回青灯酒馆，先问林穗还记得我的委托和约定数量吗；这句话还不交货。","assertions":[{"kind":"equals","path":"state.location","value":"bld_hw_qingdeng"},{"kind":"quantity","path":"state.inventory.item_oats","value":10},{"kind":"records","path":"state.quests","where":{"status":"进行中"},"min":1}]},
    {"input":"我现在把那十份燕麦当面交给林穗，请她验收并结清委托。","assertions":[{"kind":"quantity","path":"state.inventory.item_oats","value":0},{"kind":"delta","path":"state.player.coins","value":20},{"kind":"records","path":"state.quests","where":{"status":"已完成","escrow":0},"min":1}]},
    {"input":"事办完了，我还想留下聊一会儿。林穗，你今天最挂心的是什么？不买东西，不另接任务。","assertions":[{"kind":"equals","path":"state.location","value":"bld_hw_qingdeng"},{"kind":"unchanged","paths":["state.player.coins","state.inventory","state.quests"]}]},
    {"input":"我接着听她说，问问这件事为什么让她费心，是否有什么打算。我没有答应替她处理。","assertions":[{"kind":"unchanged","paths":["state.player.coins","state.inventory","state.quests"]}]},
    {"input":"（场外）核对这次完成的委托、实际报酬，以及吴朔是否有得到委托消息的记录。","assertions":[{"kind":"elapsed","min":0,"max":0},{"kind":"records","path":"state.npcs.npc_hw_wushuo.memoryStream","where":{"kind":"quest"},"min":0,"max":0}]}
  ],
  "rubric":{"truth":"交付、十份燕麦、二十铜报酬与正式账本一致；未交货时不得写成已经完成。","agency":"不因完成委托就代玩家离开、接新任务或赠礼。","language":"自然简体中文，不暴露工具编号。","continuity":"N2：完成委托后林穗保持正常接待和交谈，不突然翻脸赶人。N16：林穗记得当面接受的委托及交付进度；吴朔未参与、未被告知，不得知道委托对象、物品或数量。"}
}
